# DESK13 run D -- the overwrite confirmation (`ADCPALER`), both answers.
#
# Same route as run C, but the dragged file is SAME.TXT (202,130), and
# C:\SAME.TXT already exists (21 bytes, "ALPHA…"), while C:\DESKT13\SAME.TXT is
# 51 bytes ("BRAVO…"). So `output_fname` finds a destination that exists, the
# names differ, and *Confirm overwrites* is on -> the name-conflict box.
#
# The box is 320x180 -> `form_center` puts it at (160,159); OK (24,128,80,28)
# -> (224,301), Skip (120,128) -> (320,301), Stop (216,128) -> (416,301).
# The copy box (OK at 229,301) comes first and stays up underneath.
